{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A \u201cLittle\u201d MAGIC MISTAKE -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began with a spell that didn\u2019t go quite as planned.\u00a0Bongo, a cheerful wizard with\u2026 rather unconventional methods, was experimenting with a new magical formula\u2014but ended up merging his mind with Frank\u2019s, a little cranky knight.\u00a0Now, each step, jump, and turn is instantly mirrored, and everything one does also affects the other. Now they are forced to enter an ancient castle full of obstacles, treacherous platforms, and ingenious puzzles. Their goal? To find the potion that undoes the spell and regain control of their own bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/786857d13646477c25d836efda3b7dc6.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>SYNCHRONIZED PLATFORMING -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a platformer where the player has real-time control over two characters. Running, jumping, and moving forward are actions instantly mirrored by both characters. Even the smallest mistake can lead to a fall. Coordination isn\u2019t optional\u2014it\u2019s the main mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/2b49fc7830141de739b560b0f4cde3c8.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- COOPERATIVE PUZZLES IN A HOSTILE ENVIROMENT -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle\u2019s rooms are filled with puzzles that demand precise control and accuracy to progress.\u00a0Your ability to maintain logic and synchronization under duress is put to the test in each level. What one sees could be the key to the other's advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/babb4a600e2f0a8fc7ac07867239a6b1.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- EXPLORATION FILLED WITH UNDISCOVERED TREASURES -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the main objective, the castle has secrets for those who dare to deviate from the path. Unique collectibles are hidden in forgotten rooms and passageways, waiting to be discovered by curious players.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/842ff3a416df6b383caf1406d5ed475e.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1280 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/e6582fe401d0cfbe99419b0e53b2a28f.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/65944ba337cb1f5deca464a1e3c55d10.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/88a321c78d7ebd74f4588d1a79ecb3ff.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130900?t=1771872787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130900?t=1771872787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/a6a17c5f0558b7c7f5df40e614f4b4376ac1d635/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771872787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/a6a17c5f0558b7c7f5df40e614f4b4376ac1d635/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771872787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4360730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A \u201cLittle\u201d MAGIC MISTAKE -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began with a spell that didn\u2019t go quite as planned.\u00a0Bongo, a cheerful wizard with\u2026 rather unconventional methods, was experimenting with a new magical formula\u2014but ended up merging his mind with Frank\u2019s, a little cranky knight.\u00a0Now, each step, jump, and turn is instantly mirrored, and everything one does also affects the other. Now they are forced to enter an ancient castle full of obstacles, treacherous platforms, and ingenious puzzles. Their goal? To find the potion that undoes the spell and regain control of their own bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130900/extras/786857d13646477c25d836efda3b7dc6.avif?t=1771872787\" width=1520 height=908 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>SYNCHRONIZED P